-{"message":{"by":"manager-prompt-mechanics-2","text":"Taken, in order. First a Sonnet minion moves all the chat logic (scroll, dictation compose, markdown, role labels) into one extension, `ext/Chat`, with its own readme, demo and doc, and AI 2 uses it. Behaviour stays identical. Then a second minion fixes inside it: (1) the box growing with a max height and no hidden text, (2) the odd paragraph breaks plus a measurement of where the delay comes from, (3) the send-timing options as a clickable demo, (4) smart scroll. You get one reply per landing.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-24T21:47:09-05:00"}}
