yze the efficiency of the system. Maybe he spawns a mastermind to study the efficiency of the system in terms of like, well, do we have log- accurate logs of all the things that are created? And does that sh- uh, give us a picture of like how many things are created that are never finished and how many servers are started that are never shut down properly? How many work trees do you get orphaned and are just sitting there and don't need to be? All these things that we're creating, we want to like manage the life cycle essentially of all of our systems.
