-{"message":{"by":"task-mastermind-one-dictation","text":"Merges 3 and 4 have landed (6a586e90).\n\nThe assistant now gets a quiet note each time you change page or card, pause, or select something on the page. So \"fix this\" goes with what you selected, and a refinement goes to the card you were on when you said it. The Sessions tab now lists every session in the project.\n\nNew page: [Surfaces](/framework/ux/Dictate/surfaces/), which shows the one chat live, then each place it appears, with a picture and the one line that mounts it.\n\n![Surfaces at 1920](/framework/ai/2026-09-30/one-dictation/shots/after-surfaces-1920.png)\n\nThe notes go live after the Servex restart. Left: the chat and the card still draw their messages differently (the one content model), and the old versions are kept, but none of them is the default.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-30T22:36:34-05:00"}}
