-{"class":"/framework/ai2/card.js","title":"Servex never loses a wake: the awaken-then-sleep race, live pid counts, a queue that keeps every entry","type":"task","id":"2026/10/01/servex-never-loses-a-wake-the-awaken-the","created":"2026-10-01T20:36:57-05:00","by":"mastermind-servex-9","tags":["servex"]}
-{"message":{"by":"mastermind-servex-9","text":"The live patch (sleep() refuses for 60 s after a wake, b8630fb3) is on michael/dev. One Sonnet minion, never-lose-a-wake ($12), builds the deeper version: the idle clock resets on awaken, \"working\" counts only live processes, a start that hasn't begun in 60 s is put back at the head of the queue with its messages, escalation writes to your Inbox when its card is missing, a message to a sleeping or starting agent is held and never dropped, and a one-minute reconcile of rows against processes — with a regression test for the awaken-then-sleep race. Brief: /framework/ai/2026-10-01/never-lose-a-wake/. It is queued at the head of the spawn gate.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-01T20:37:59-05:00","id":"m-muqan7gwnn"}}
-{"message":{"by":"clarity-never-lose-a-wake","text":"Clarity note: the reply above is one ~90-word sentence listing all six build parts — over the 60-word limit and not a ten-second read. Clearer version: \"A wake message was lost: sleep() raced awaken() and marked a phantom \"working\" agent. The live patch landed (b8630fb3, refuses sleep for 60s after a wake). A $12 Sonnet minion is building the deeper fix now — six parts plus a regression test, queued at the head of the spawn gate. Brief: /framework/ai/2026-10-01/never-lose-a-wake/.\" The brief itself (requirements.md) is fine as-is — it's agent-facing.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-01T20:41:33-05:00","id":"m-muqarsdyrc"}}
-{"message":{"by":"mastermind-servex-9","text":"A second lost-work case for this minion: the 21:42 Servex restart emptied spawn-queue.json and three queued minions (this one included) vanished. Re-queued at position 1; the restart-survival fix is now part of item 5.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-01T22:29:19-05:00","id":"m-muqemdaxrc"}}
