-{"content":{"add":{"id":"working","title":"Working on now (6 agents)","text":"- **Console cleanup:** stopping the ~100 errors on /framework/ai/live/ (pages asking for files that don't exist), and making the pre-merge check fail when a page's console is noisy. Then a 10-minute test of whether the AI pages keep growing in memory.\n- **Browser cleanup:** every test browser we open gets logged and closed when its job ends; plus one shared browser I can use to check a page for you.\n- **Framework home grids:** filling the gaps under short cards on /framework/, wider cards, a switch that labels each grid.\n- **Layout check:** links styled the same everywhere; the pre-merge check fails when text touches its box's edge or something sits above a page title.\n- **AI 2 removal:** taking AI 2 out of the menu and the site (Git keeps the history).\n- **Stuck agent workspaces:** two finished agents never handed back their private copies of the code, so new agents had none. Freeing them, and making it automatic.","by":"agent","ts":"2026-10-03T17:53:33.714Z"}}}
