-{"title":"AI system: the dashboard you're reading","text":"**Landed today**\n- **Cards show their content:** a section's text now appears under its title, on white cards over a gray background, and the card scrolls.\n- **No more 404 on Your prompts** (/framework/ai/your-prompts/).\n- **AI 2 is out of the menu** (first step of retiring it).\n- **A data-corrupting edit bug fixed:** changing one section no longer blanks the card's title.\n- **Console is quiet:** the ~100 missing-file errors on /framework/ai/live/ are gone, and a page with a noisy console can't be merged any more.\n\n**Working on now**\n- **Readable cards** (@task-mastermind-inbox-cards-work): previews that say something real, plain-word titles, the Activity tab bug.\n- **The drawer** (@task-mastermind-drawer-cleanup): a tight header, one scrolling chat area, the talk box pinned to the bottom with no double padding.\n- **The rest of AI 2** (@mastermind-ai-3): moving the code the new page still uses, then deleting the old folder.","by":"agent","ts":"2026-10-03T18:16:24.335Z"}
