-{"talking":{"text":"- **Is there a System class?** Not yet. It was planned on Sep 30 (`System extends Doc`, so every system gets the same top tabs) and queued, then never started. Started now: @task-mastermind-system-class. Design, Code, UI, UX and AI become Systems.\n- **Every reference must be a link,** agent names included; and the uneven spacing under \"Landed today\" / \"Working on now\". With @task-mastermind-inbox-cards-work.\n- **The AI and Page sections should be dark page cards.** Queued first with @mastermind-page-3.\n- **Chrome pop-ups (3).** Agents' Playwright tool opened visible windows. Blocked for every agent; they use the invisible `check_page`.\n- **The page icon before every Doc title.** Done: the robot face before \"AI\".\n- **Referencing a page cheaply.** One index of icons and titles that the server rebuilds itself. Queued with @mastermind-page-3.\n- **The drawer;** **cards and prose on one margin; padding by default; adaptive backgrounds.** In progress."},"by":"vscode-mastermind","ts":"2026-10-03T13:25:23-05:00"}
