-{"content":{"add":{"title":"Topics: one call each way","text":"Each topic above is a REAL sub-card, one folder deeper (`now/<topic-slug>/`), the same mechanism `your-prompts-refined-live` already used — not a new one.\n\n**Making a topic:** `create_card({ parent: \"2026/10/03/now\", title, type: \"note\" })`, then `page_add` for its body (what was said, the answer, links to the agents on it). The parent card lists it automatically — no second line to write.\n\n**Replying into the right place:** `card_reply({ card: \"2026/10/03/now/<topic-slug>\", text })` talks into that ONE topic, never the top of the Now card. To answer one statement inside a topic (once sentence ids are wired, see below), `card_reply` takes `re: \"<statement id>\"` and nests the reply under it.\n\n**Still open:** the owner's own statements aren't yet linked in with sentence ids — that depends on @task-mastermind-prompts-live's remaining per-prompt sub-card wiring (its checklist still has this unticked) and a deeper event break routed to @mastermind-servex. Until then a topic's body is written by hand from the Now card's own log, same as every other section here.","by":"task-mastermind-topic-cards","id":"20b7afb1-a342-4c89-912d-b7d3c7ac0fd6","ts":"2026-10-03T19:47:14.265Z"}}}
