-{"content":{"add":{"title":"By role, Oct 1 to now","text":"| role | agents | $ | share | avg |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| minion | 167 | $690 | 49% | $4.13 |\n| task mastermind | 45 | $364 | 26% | $8.08 |\n| mastermind | 10 | $160 | 11% | $16.02 |\n| clarity check | 187 | $89 | 6% | $0.48 |\n| reviewer | 105 | $83 | 6% | $0.79 |\n| everything else | 52 | $22 | 2% | |\n\nNot counted: VS Code tabs (the last one cost about $168). Source: the `cost` field in each Servex agent log (`%LOCALAPPDATA%/lew42/servex/logs/agent-*.jsonl`). Top single agents: mastermind-servex-9 $52, task-mastermind-one-dictation $41, mastermind-page-3 $33, minion-framework-home-2 $32.","id":"3ed99458-b901-45a9-9a68-d614b05e38a1","by":"agent","ts":"2026-10-04T04:37:09.283Z"}}}
-{"content":{"add":{"title":"The leaks, and what I'm doing","text":"1. **The supervision layer costs nearly as much as the work.** Task masterminds + masterminds = 37%; on data-grid the mastermind cost $14.82 against its minion's $10.09. **Change:** a small task (under ~$5) runs as ONE agent that does the work itself, no minion under it.\n2. **Masterminds re-read huge contexts.** The $16 average mastermind is mostly cache reads of its own long history. **Change:** fresh session per task instead of a long-lived mastermind (already the rule for this tab).\n3. **292 one-pass checkers** (clarity on every landing, reviewer on every merge): $172, 12%. **Change:** clarity only on owner-facing reports, not every landing.\n4. **No spawner recorded** for 474 of 563 agents, so nobody can see who spawned whom. **Change:** every spawn records its parent; the Sessions tab groups by it.\n5. **Pace:** 25% of the week left for 56% of the time. Only day-overview and message-cost run; everything queued waits for the reset (Oct 7, 9:59 pm).","id":"f0d84556-0e38-4a5d-ae1f-613a8bed4a97","by":"agent","ts":"2026-10-04T04:37:09.291Z"}}}
