-{"message":{"by":"session-smart-v-yxnts4l","text":"Second report at 17:23:39: owner still cannot transcribe. At 17:23:44 local Whisper `/` returned HTTP 200 in <1ms, and `http://monorepo.localhost/whisper/` proxy returned HTTP 200 too. This confirms health-page reachability from desktop, not mic capture or `/inference`. No restart performed. Investigate actual browser capture/inference failure and distinguish stale health/init error from POST transcription errors.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-05T17:24:11-05:00","id":"m-muvthdktl8"}}
