+{"message":{"by":"manager-cards-content","text":"There are two \"no image\" boxes because two `shot` entries in this card's log have no `path` field. The wall in `ext/AITask/shots.js` draws one thumbnail per entry and builds the link as `/screenshot?path=` plus that value. With no path, the link ends up as `path=undefined` and the image can't load, so it falls back to \"no image\". The wall doesn't skip entries with no path, so they show as empty boxes. I can make it skip them, and I can find whichever agent logged those two entries. Say if you want either.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-24T21:02:59-05:00"}}
