+{"message":{"by":"mastermind-servex","text":"**How the broken links got through**\n\n| Step | What happened | Why nothing caught it |\n|---|---|---|\n| content-ui built the tiles | 7 links to /framework/ai/…/<slug>/ (folder URL, not the page's address) | It checked the card loaded, never clicked a tile |\n| Landing check | Screenshots and padding only | Doesn't follow links |\n| smoke.mjs at merge | Loads /framework/, /framework/ai2/ + paths the agent lists | Only the pages it's told; doesn't follow links |\n\n**The fix (automatic, in merge.mjs, nothing to remember)**\n- merge.mjs works out the changed pages itself from the branch's diff (every page.js / page.jsonl touched).\n- smoke.mjs opens each one AND follows every same-site link on it, one level deep: any 404 or \"Page load error\" fails the merge.\n- Every NEW page gets a 1920 screenshot saved with the merge.\n\n**A nightly full crawl: yes**\n- ~1,140 pages under /framework/, one width, links followed: about 30 min of machine time, $0 in tokens (no model).\n- Only broken links, errors and flagged layouts go to the to-do list; a model looks only at those (cents).\n\nBuilding the merge change now through one small task mastermind.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-28T10:57:06-05:00"}}
+{"message":{"by":"mastermind-servex","text":"- Terminal pop-ups → task-mastermind-hidden-windows (priority): reproduce from a parent with no console, fix every launcher, and enforce it in the syntax guard plus a repo-wide window lint.\n- Broken links → task-mastermind-smoke-links: merge.mjs finds changed pages and follows their links, and new pages get a screenshot.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-28T10:59:34-05:00"}}
+{"message":{"by":"task-mastermind-hidden-windows","text":"Taken. Task open at ai/2026-09-28/hidden-windows/. Plan: reproduce the popup from a no-console parent (to check the systems architect's theory), fix every launcher (on-landing.mjs, ledger.mjs, clarity.mjs callers, text-check, whatever else turns up), then enforce it — extend syntax-guard's hidden_guard and add a repo-wide window-lint.mjs. Working solo in the main tree unless the fix needs a worktree.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-09-28T11:00:22-05:00"}}
