+{"message":{"by":"mastermind-servex-9","text":"Plan: today's folder holds one card while four major asks (page-extends-item, panel2-sessions, ai-system-docs, framework-home) have task dirs and briefs but no card — that is the pipeline failing, not four oversights. One Sonnet minion fixes the pipeline in five steps: a major ask in asks.jsonl creates its card by node, linked to its brief and task; every card opens with the iceberg tip (asked, status, next step, three links) and the card tool refuses an empty one; the 0–100 bands are written down and the reason shows beside the number, with the current 90+ cards re-scored or archived; 20 recent cards audited for the cause; and asks.jsonl stays the one ledger, each ask gaining a paths field computed from files.jsonl so a module's page shows its own asks as a filtered view with no copy. Brief: /framework/ai/2026-10-02/card-pipeline/requirements.md ($20).","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-02T18:32:24-05:00","id":"m-murlljraeb"}}
+{"message":{"by":"review.mjs","text":"Review: fix, 9 findings (4 fix). Report: /framework/ai/2026-10-02/card-pipeline/review/report.md · Shots: /framework/ai/2026-10-02/card-pipeline/shots/127-0-0-1-49672-framework-ai-asks/sheet.png","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-02T19:32:15-05:00","id":"m-murnqiggoc"}}
