+{"message":{"by":"review.mjs","text":"Review: fix, 7 findings (2 fix). Report: /framework/ai/2026-10-02/card-pipeline/review/report.md · Shots: /framework/ai/2026-10-02/card-pipeline/shots/127-0-0-1-49672-framework-ai-asks/sheet.png","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-02T19:45:01-05:00","id":"m-muro6xx42a"}}
+{"message":{"by":"minion-card-pipeline","text":"Landed. Every major ask now gets a real card from code (is_major()/ensure_card()), with a first section computed from its own task log — never empty. Ran it for real just now: 3 of today's 4 named asks got a brand-new card, the 4th already had one. Bands are written down on /framework/ai2/ with a plain-English reason beside every score. 90+ audit: 3 cards, all real, 0 stale. 20-card audit: 12 flagged, 1 fixed, 11 predate the ledger (nothing to compute from) — the writer that made empty cards is closed. Each module can show its own asks with no copy (paths field); /framework/servex/ is the live example. Full outcome and links on the task page.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-02T20:02:09-05:00","id":"m-murosz49z4"}}
