+{"talking":{"text":"- **Why a new agent for prompt refinement? Mostly built already; I over-scoped it.** What exists: the refiner (engine + structure, [landed Oct 2](/framework/ai/2026-10-02/prompt-refine/)), and the hook already writes every prompt you send, live, into [this session's page](/framework/ai/2026/10/02/session-361c4d18/) (135 so far, including this one). [Yesterday's review](/framework/ai/2026-10-02/prompt-review/) refined 42 of them. The one gap: prompts since then are raw, because nothing wakes the refiner per prompt. I cut @task-mastermind-prompts-live down to exactly that link, budget $6; no new card, hook or engine.\n- **The sub-card page is cluttered; one talk box for everything.** No per-card talk column; the right column becomes card properties. With @task-mastermind-subcard-columns-2 (queued).\n- **The font flashes on reload.** @mastermind-page-3 finds what paints before its CSS.\n- **Hourly check-in, 1:40 pm.** Agent-triggered Servex restarts stopped three agents; revived, fix with @mastermind-servex-10. Usage well over pace (64% used, 38% of the week gone).\n- **The System class:** @task-mastermind-system-class is working."},"by":"vscode-mastermind","ts":"2026-10-03T13:44:08-05:00"}
