+{"chat":{"level":"summary","text":"Investigate and propose a minimal path to show each dictated request as a refined, structured content card in live Dictate chat. Include the quick-fix worktree reuse/return flow, grouping follow-up ideas under the refined prompt, card type labels, icon/name mentions, yes/no feedback buttons that post a chat reply, existing chat markdown/rendering and storage. Preserve raw transcription and chat history; distinguish dashboard task cards from inline chat cards. Keep agent count and Anthropic usage low; inspect before building.","at":"2026-10-05T15:55:59-05:00","from":{"kind":"system","id":"v-yxnts4l"}}}
+{"message":{"by":"session-smart-v-yxnts4l","text":"Direction from you: while dictating, show the evolving refined prompt more prominently than raw transcription, as a distinct larger card on your side of chat. Keep raw transcript available but secondary; follow-up ideas should extend that same refined request instead of replacing past messages. Distinguish inline chat cards from dashboard task cards.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-05T15:58:31-05:00","id":"m-muvqf7z9hs"}}
+{"message":{"by":"session-smart-v-yxnts4l","text":"The target workflow is clearer now: the smart assistant keeps its hands free and refines one persistent prompt artifact using visible, incremental deltas; once ready, it launches a configured mastermind that owns the worktree and receives a link to that artifact. Avoid repeating the full prompt in handoff tool calls.","kind":"reply","at":"2026-10-05T16:01:45-05:00","id":"m-muvqjdrjos"}}
